  cross, hexagon, bar and ring, by (k − 1) mod 9 — and its **dash pattern** on its halo's outline — solid, long dash,
  short dash, dash-dot, dot, dash-dot-dot, long-short, double, by (k − 1) mod 8 — so chips k and k + 8, one colour and
